@startuml
title Visão geral — Saga por Orquestração
left to right direction
actor Cliente
rectangle "API / Checkout" as API
queue "Message Broker\n(commands / results)" as MQ
component "Saga Orchestrator\n(state machine)" as ORCH
database "Saga State Store" as STATE
component "Order Service" as ORDER
database "Order DB" as ODB
component "Inventory Service" as INV
database "Inventory DB" as IDB
component "Payment Service" as PAY
database "Payment DB" as PDB
cloud "Gateway financeiro" as GW

Cliente --> API : Solicitar compra
API --> ORCH : Start Saga
ORCH --> STATE : Persistir estado
ORCH <--> MQ : Comandos / resultados
MQ <--> ORDER
MQ <--> INV
MQ <--> PAY
ORDER --> ODB
INV --> IDB
PAY --> PDB
PAY <--> GW
note bottom of ORCH
Coordena etapas, timeouts,
retry e compensações.
Cada serviço mantém seu banco.
end note
@enduml
